619
00:58:13,714 --> 00:58:19,854
はい、TikTokの方、皆さんよろしくお願いします。はい、22時10分からね、MVプレミアム公開もされますので、
Everyone, please check out TikTok. And starting at 22:10, the MV premiere will also be available,

620
00:58:19,854 --> 00:58:23,634
よろしくお願いします。というわけで、こちらのステージで！
so please look forward to it. With that said, on this stage—

621
00:58:23,634 --> 00:58:25,194
初披露させていただきたいと思います！
I'd like to perform it for the very first time!

622
00:58:25,194 --> 00:58:30,334
じゃあ、いいですか、準備できてますか、皆さん？いきますよ！
Are you ready? Is everyone ready? Here we go!

623
00:58:30,934 --> 00:58:37,674
最後、終わり曲、右左君君右下目上きゅるんめちょかわです！
And finally, the last song: "Right, Left, You, You, Right, Bottom, Look Up, So Damn Cute!"

624
00:58:41,883 --> 00:58:45,623
左右君君右下目上きゅるんめちょかわ！
Right, left, you, you, right, bottom, look up, so damn cute!

625
00:59:01,147 --> 00:59:10,867
あれやこれや言ったって結局要は面図じゃん？
ずっと傍に居るなんて正直前提じゃん？あぁ
No matter what anyone says, looks are what matter most in the end, right?
Always being by your side is basically a given, right? Ah...

626
00:59:21,267 --> 00:59:30,307
あの子よりも上だって大体背伸びどんぐりじゃん？
マジな話かみだってリュックの中身パンパンじゃん？
Thinking you're better than that girl is just stretching like an acorn, right?
Honestly speaking, your backpack is stuffed full, right?

627
00:59:30,307 --> 00:59:39,967
でもでも君となら 目指すまっすぐでひた向きで
心掴む理想の子に
Even so, if I'm with you, aiming straight ahead with single-minded devotion, grabbing your heart inside the ideal person's depth...

628
00:59:40,707 --> 00:59:45,407
見て？頭の先から爪先まで
君好みのカスタムスタイル
Look? From the top of my head to the tips of my toes,
It's a custom style just the way you like it.

629
00:59:46,207 --> 00:59:50,027
網子に乗って落ち込んで
泣いちゃう日もあるけど
Getting caught in the ropes and falling down,
there are days when I cry, but—

630
00:59:50,527 --> 00:59:53,107
さあロケラングレランきみだけ
Come on, rocket launcher, grenade launcher, just for you!

631
00:59:53,107 --> 00:59:56,127
もう残弾あるだけ撃ち込め(どかーん！)
Shoot away with all the remaining ammo! (Boom!)

632
00:59:56,127 --> 00:59:59,047
爆風もくふわ♡キメたら
Once you nail that fluffy blast wave,

633
00:59:59,047 --> 01:00:01,167
文句はこれでないね？
There are no complaints left, right?

634
01:00:01,167 --> 01:00:05,252
左右君君右下目上きゅるんめちょかわ！(ふわふわ！)
Right, left, you, you, right, bottom, look up, so damn cute! (Fluffy fluffy!)

635
01:00:06,597 --> 01:00:10,227
斜め右あざとさ舌ペろマジ顔もめっちゃかわいい！
Glancing up-right, acting cute with a tongue-poke—seriously, even her face is super cute!

636
01:00:12,677 --> 01:00:22,077
夜ふかし極めて逆に健康だ
Mastering staying up late is actually healthy in reverse.

637
01:00:24,427 --> 01:00:26,377
「宿題日過ぎてます！」
"My homework is past due!"

638
01:00:26,377 --> 01:00:28,777
「炎上だけは勘弁です！」
"Please, anything but getting cancelled!"

639
01:00:29,277 --> 01:00:32,027
そう言われても約束できない
Even if you say that, I can't promise anything,

640
01:00:32,027 --> 01:00:34,227
好きな事だけ爆速でいたい
I just want to speed through doing what I love.

641
01:00:34,427 --> 01:00:36,127
「そんな所も大好きです！」
"I love those parts about you too!"

642
01:00:36,277 --> 01:00:38,527
「今日も生きててえらちゃんです！」
"You did a great job just surviving today!"

643
01:00:38,677 --> 01:00:43,077
そう褒められると申し訳ない… 期待下回った人間です…
I feel guilty being praised like that... I'm someone who fell short of expectations...

644
01:00:43,577 --> 01:00:47,477
でもでもでもでも君だから
But, but, but, but because it's you,

645
01:00:47,777 --> 01:00:51,077
誓うまっすぐにひたむきに 心から揺らす君の為に
I swear, straight and devoted, for your sake, shaking from the bottom of my heart,

646
01:00:54,277 --> 01:00:57,477
ほら頭の先から爪まで 君好みのナチュラルスタイル
Look, from the top of my head down to my claws, your favorite natural style,

647
01:00:59,177 --> 01:01:01,977
うさちゃんパジャマのままだし ５度寝する日もあるけど
Staying in bunny pajamas, though there are days I hit snooze five times,

648
01:01:03,877 --> 01:01:06,177
でもいつでもエイムは君タゲ
Still, my aim is always locked on you.

649
01:01:06,177 --> 01:01:08,577
もう残弾ないけど撃ち抜け(ずきゅーん！)
I'm out of ammo, but shoot right through (Bang!)

650
01:01:08,577 --> 01:01:11,277
「帽子に載っても良いよね？」
"It's fine if I sit on your hat, right?"

651
01:01:11,277 --> 01:01:13,777
「文句は後で聞きます…」
"I'll hear your complaints later..."

652
01:01:13,777 --> 01:01:17,477
右左君君右上目きゅるんめんちょかわかわ？(ふわふわ！)
Right, left, you, you, up, right, up-gazing, sparkling, super cute? (Fluffy!)

653
01:01:17,977 --> 01:01:23,077
斜め右あざとさ舌ペろマジ顔もめっちゃかわいい！
Glancing up-right, acting cute with a tongue-poke—seriously, even her face is super cute!

654
01:01:37,777 --> 01:01:40,277
2周年ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for 2 years!

655
01:01:40,277 --> 01:01:46,777
3周年目も みんなよろちゃんです！楽しかった、ありがとう！
For the 3rd year too, please take care of us everyone! It was fun, thank you!

